thouse Hours\n M-F 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\n\n Closed Holidays\n\n Department Hours May Vary\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Cerro Gordo County · Employee Portal\n \npowered by \n \n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeterans Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving Day (November 26, 2026)\n \nDay After Thanksgiving (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \nNew Year's Day (January 1, 2027)\n \n\n\n\n\n"
